  (2, '2 - Central Trial Documents', '2.01', '2.01 - Product and Trial Documentation', '02.01.02', '02.01.02 - Protocol ', 'To describe the objective(s), design, methodology, statistical considerations and organization of a trial. Usually also gives the background and rationale for the trial, but these could also be provided in other protocol referenced documents. Includes Special Protocols.', 'Protocol', 'Core', true, true, true, '01 First Country RA Approval', true, '01 First Country RA Approval', true, 'Version Date', 2, 'Develop Study Design / Study Conduct'),
