  (11, '11 - Statistics', '11.01', '11.01 - Statistics Oversight', '11.01.01', '11.01.01 - Statistical Analysis Plan ', 'To describe the statistical aspects of the trial design, the process of data selection for all analyzes, the data items to be analyzed and all the procedures and methods to be employed in the analysis of those data items as well as the planned presentation of those results (Tables, Listings and Figures (TLFs), all versions of the SAP and approval forms). Includes interim and final.', 'Analysis Convention Document', 'Core', true, true, true, '03 Site Live / Ready / Open for Enrollment', false, NULL, false, 'Version Date', 12, 'Develop Trial Management Strategy'),
