  (6, '6 - IP and Trial Supplies', '6.06', '6.06 - Interactive Response Technology', '06.06.03', '06.06.03 - IRT User Acceptance Testing (UAT) Certification', 'To document the acceptability of the series of assessments of the IRT performed by key users of the system that are designed to show that the IRT has been correctly programmed and meets the requirements of the User Requirements Specification (URS). Minimally, the signature page and may include validation or other documentation.', 'IRT UAT Certification', 'Core', true, true, true, '02 Clinical Infrastructure Ready', false, NULL, false, 'Certification Date', 22, 'Manage Project / Manage IP'),
