  (3, '3 - Regulatory', '3.03', '3.03 - Trial Status Reporting', '03.03.01', '03.03.01 - Notification of Safety or Trial Information', 'Notification to Regulatory Authorities of any trial events that could alter the regulatory authority''s approval/favorable opinion to continue the trial. Notifications may include, but are not limited to: Quarterly line listings, suspected unexpected serious adverse reactions (SUSARs), Unexpected Serious Adverse Device Events (USADE), Council for International Organizations of Medical Sciences (CIOMS), MedWatch, Analysis of Similar Events, Serious Breaches, cover letters and/or country-specific reporting forms.', 'Evidence of Distribution of Safety Information', 'Core', true, true, false, NULL, true, '11 Ongoing', false, 'Notification Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (3, '3 - Regulatory', '3.03', '3.03 - Trial Status Reporting', '03.03.01', '03.03.01 - Notification of Safety or Trial Information', 'Notification to Regulatory Authorities of any trial events that could alter the regulatory authority''s approval/favorable opinion to continue the trial. Notifications may include, but are not limited to: Quarterly line listings, suspected unexpected serious adverse reactions (SUSARs), Unexpected Serious Adverse Device Events (USADE), Council for International Organizations of Medical Sciences (CIOMS), MedWatch, Analysis of Similar Events, Serious Breaches, cover letters and/or country-specific reporting forms.', 'Evidence of Distribution of Trial Information', 'Core', true, true, false, NULL, true, '11 Ongoing', false, 'Notification Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (3, '3 - Regulatory', '3.03', '3.03 - Trial Status Reporting', '03.03.01', '03.03.01 - Notification of Safety or Trial Information', 'Notification to Regulatory Authorities of any trial events that could alter the regulatory authority''s approval/favorable opinion to continue the trial. Notifications may include, but are not limited to: Quarterly line listings, suspected unexpected serious adverse reactions (SUSARs), Unexpected Serious Adverse Device Events (USADE), Council for International Organizations of Medical Sciences (CIOMS), MedWatch, Analysis of Similar Events, Serious Breaches, cover letters and/or country-specific reporting forms.', 'Notification of Safety Information', 'Core', true, true, false, NULL, true, '11 Ongoing', false, 'Notification Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (3, '3 - Regulatory', '3.03', '3.03 - Trial Status Reporting', '03.03.01', '03.03.01 - Notification of Safety or Trial Information', 'Notification to Regulatory Authorities of any trial events that could alter the regulatory authority''s approval/favorable opinion to continue the trial. Notifications may include, but are not limited to: Quarterly line listings, suspected unexpected serious adverse reactions (SUSARs), Unexpected Serious Adverse Device Events (USADE), Council for International Organizations of Medical Sciences (CIOMS), MedWatch, Analysis of Similar Events, Serious Breaches, cover letters and/or country-specific reporting forms.', 'Notification of Trial Information', 'Core', true, true, false, NULL, true, '11 Ongoing', false, 'Notification Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (4, '4 - IRB or IEC and other Approvals', '4.03', '4.03 - Trial Status Reporting', '04.03.01', '04.03.01 - Notification to IRB or IEC of Safety Information', 'To assure the IRB/IEC are promptly notified of all findings (new, important information on serious adverse events and or safety concerns) that could adversely affect the safety of subjects, impact the conduct of the trial or alter the IRB/IEC''s approval/favorable opinion to continue the trial. Notifications/Communication may include but are not limited to - periodic safety line listings, USADEs, SUSARs, CIOMS, MedWatch, Analysis of Similar Events, cover letters and/or IRB/IEC-specific reporting forms. The records referenced in these notifications may be filed as appropriate in Zone 07. May include IRB/IEC Acknowledgement of Receipt.', 'Acknowledgement of Receipt of Safety Information', 'Core', true, true, false, NULL, true, '05 Significant Study Event', true, 'Notification Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (4, '4 - IRB or IEC and other Approvals', '4.03', '4.03 - Trial Status Reporting', '04.03.01', '04.03.01 - Notification to IRB or IEC of Safety Information', 'To assure the IRB/IEC are promptly notified of all findings (new, important information on serious adverse events and or safety concerns) that could adversely affect the safety of subjects, impact the conduct of the trial or alter the IRB/IEC''s approval/favorable opinion to continue the trial. Notifications/Communication may include but are not limited to - periodic safety line listings, USADEs, SUSARs, CIOMS, MedWatch, Analysis of Similar Events, cover letters and/or IRB/IEC-specific reporting forms. The records referenced in these notifications may be filed as appropriate in Zone 07. May include IRB/IEC Acknowledgement of Receipt.', 'Evidence of Distribution of Safety Information', 'Core', true, true, false, NULL, true, '05 Significant Study Event', true, 'Notification Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (4, '4 - IRB or IEC and other Approvals', '4.03', '4.03 - Trial Status Reporting', '04.03.01', '04.03.01 - Notification to IRB or IEC of Safety Information', 'To assure the IRB/IEC are promptly notified of all findings (new, important information on serious adverse events and or safety concerns) that could adversely affect the safety of subjects, impact the conduct of the trial or alter the IRB/IEC''s approval/favorable opinion to continue the trial. Notifications/Communication may include but are not limited to - periodic safety line listings, USADEs, SUSARs, CIOMS, MedWatch, Analysis of Similar Events, cover letters and/or IRB/IEC-specific reporting forms. The records referenced in these notifications may be filed as appropriate in Zone 07. May include IRB/IEC Acknowledgement of Receipt.', 'Notification to IRB or IEC of Safety Information', 'Core', true, true, false, NULL, true, '05 Significant Study Event', true, 'Notification Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (5, '5 - Site Management', '5.04', '5.04 - Site Management', '05.04.09', '05.04.09 - Notification to Investigators of Safety Information', 'To assure investigators are promptly notified of all findings (new, important information on serious adverse events and or safety concerns) that could adversely affect the safety of subjects, impact the conduct of the trial or alter their IRB/IEC''s approval/favorable opinion to continue the trial. Notifications may include but are not limited to Safety line listings, SUSARs, CIOMS, MedWatch, Analysis of Similar Events, cover letters and/or country-specific reporting forms. 
', 'Evidence of Safety Information Distribution', 'Core', true, true, true, '05 Significant Study Event', false, NULL, true, 'Notification Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (5, '5 - Site Management', '5.04', '5.04 - Site Management', '05.04.09', '05.04.09 - Notification to Investigators of Safety Information', 'To assure investigators are promptly notified of all findings (new, important information on serious adverse events and or safety concerns) that could adversely affect the safety of subjects, impact the conduct of the trial or alter their IRB/IEC''s approval/favorable opinion to continue the trial. Notifications may include but are not limited to Safety line listings, SUSARs, CIOMS, MedWatch, Analysis of Similar Events, cover letters and/or country-specific reporting forms. 
', 'Notification to Investigators of Safety Information', 'Core', true, true, true, '05 Significant Study Event', false, NULL, true, 'Notification Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (7, '7 - Safety Reporting', '7.01', '7.01 - Safety Documentation', '07.01.02', '07.01.02 - Pharmacovigilance Database Line Listing', 'Listing of trial data for a single study trial used for a variety of safety evaluation of the investigational product purposes (e.g. Serious Adverse Events (SAE) case listings, database line listings, etc.). 

This artifact may not be trial specific, thus may include a reference to program/IP level records. One example of where this artifact would be expected to be trial-specific is when a CRO performs this function for a single trial.', 'Annual Safety Report (ASR)', 'Core', true, true, true, '11 Ongoing', false, NULL, false, 'Report Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (7, '7 - Safety Reporting', '7.01', '7.01 - Safety Documentation', '07.01.02', '07.01.02 - Pharmacovigilance Database Line Listing', 'Listing of trial data for a single study trial used for a variety of safety evaluation of the investigational product purposes (e.g. Serious Adverse Events (SAE) case listings, database line listings, etc.). 

This artifact may not be trial specific, thus may include a reference to program/IP level records. One example of where this artifact would be expected to be trial-specific is when a CRO performs this function for a single trial.', 'Development Safety Update Report (DSUR)', 'Core', true, true, true, '11 Ongoing', false, NULL, false, 'Report Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (7, '7 - Safety Reporting', '7.01', '7.01 - Safety Documentation', '07.01.02', '07.01.02 - Pharmacovigilance Database Line Listing', 'Listing of trial data for a single study trial used for a variety of safety evaluation of the investigational product purposes (e.g. Serious Adverse Events (SAE) case listings, database line listings, etc.). 

This artifact may not be trial specific, thus may include a reference to program/IP level records. One example of where this artifact would be expected to be trial-specific is when a CRO performs this function for a single trial.', 'Pharmacovigilance Database Line Listing', 'Core', true, true, true, '11 Ongoing', false, NULL, false, 'Report Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (7, '7 - Safety Reporting', '7.02', '7.02 - Trial Status Reporting', '07.02.01', '07.02.01 - Expedited Safety Report', 'To document unexpected serious adverse drug reactions and other safety information; submitted to regulatory authorities and IRBs/IECs. Submission artifact is located in 03.03.01.', 'Expedited Safety Report', 'Core', true, true, true, '05 Significant Study Event', false, NULL, true, 'Report Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (7, '7 - Safety Reporting', '7.02', '7.02 - Trial Status Reporting', '07.02.02', '07.02.02 - SAE Report', 'To organize critical data around a serious adverse event, adverse event and/or a laboratory abnormality as identified in the protocol. Reports may include, but are not limited to: specific investigator SAE report forms and supporting data, reporter correspondence, associated note-to-files, source documentation, case logs, narratives, case unblinding forms and/or safety database case printouts. 
', 'SAE Report', 'Core', true, true, true, '11 Ongoing', false, NULL, true, 'Report Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (7, '7 - Safety Reporting', '7.02', '7.02 - Trial Status Reporting', '07.02.03', '07.02.03 - Pregnancy Report', 'To organize critical data around a pregnancy that occurred whilst either the male or the female subject was participating in a clinical trial. Reporting forms and supporting data collected for pregnancy cases and their outcome. Reports may include but are not limited to specific regulatory forms and supporting data, reporter correspondence, associated note-to-files, source documentation, case logs, case unblinding form, narratives and/or safety database case printouts.', 'Pregnancy Report', 'Core', true, false, true, '11 Ongoing', false, NULL, true, 'Report Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (7, '7 - Safety Reporting', '7.03', '7.03 - General', '07.03.01', '07.03.01 - Relevant Communications', 'Zone-specific, trial specific agreements, significant discussions or relevant information, but not specifically listed in this Reference Model. Types of correspondence may include, but not limited to: letters, memo, electronic communications and faxes. (Does not include program level communications.)', 'Relevant Communications', 'Core', true, true, true, '11 Ongoing', false, NULL, true, 'Correspondence Date', 28, 'Manage Subject Risk / Report Safety Issue(s)'),
  (7, '7 - Safety Reporting', '7.02', '7.02 - Trial Status Reporting', '07.02.04', '07.02.04 - Special Events of Interest', 'To organize critical data around a special event of interest, one that is of scientific and medical concern specific to the product or program. Usually requested by or submitted to Regulatory Agencies. Reports may include but are not limited to specific regulatory forms and supporting data, reporter correspondence, associated note-to-files, source documentation, case logs, narratives, case unblinding forms and/or safety database case printouts.', 'Special Events of Interest', 'Core', false, false, true, '11 Ongoing', false, NULL, true, 'Report Date', 29, 'Manage Subject Risk / Manage Urgent Safety Measures'),
  (6, '6 - IP and Trial Supplies', '6.03', '6.03 - IP Allocation Documentation', '06.03.03', '06.03.03 - IP Treatment Decoding Documentation ', 'To document the action of breaking the blind for an individual subject, urgently if needed, or when interim or final unblinding occurs. Treatment unblinding may be controlled by interactive response technology (IRT) and or manually using code break envelopes.', 'Emergency Decoding Authorization Document', 'Core', true, false, true, '08 Database Lock', false, NULL, true, 'Document Date', 30, 'Manage Subject Risk / Break Blind'),
