  (11, '11 - Statistics', '11.02', '11.02 - Randomization', '11.02.06', '11.02.06 - End of Trial or Interim Unblinding', 'To document and authorize the release of the randomization code and allow the trial data to be unblinded. Includes evidence of release of end of trial unblinding. May include a request for partial unblinding, or to open the randomization list for maintenance by randomization management personnel.', 'Administrative Interim Unblinding Request Form', 'Core', true, true, true, '10 Final Report / Clinical Study Report Approved', false, NULL, false, 'Signature Date', 30, 'Manage Subject Risk / Break Blind'),
